Package: scSimEvalStudio
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Shiny Studio for scSimEval Single-Cell Multiomics Benchmarking
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kabilan", "Sakthivel", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "kabilan151414@gmail.com",
      comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-9422-0938"))
  )
Description: Companion graphical Shiny web interface for the 'scSimEval'
    Bioconductor package. Enables interactive uploading of single-cell RNA-seq,
    scATAC-seq, and paired or unpaired multiomics SingleCellExperiment datasets,
    execution of the 56-measure evaluation suite, interactive bubble-matrix and
    ordination exploration, and export of publication-quality figures and
    tabular reports.
